id: pm-gantt-chart-722n
title: Repin the gated pm-github issue sync caller to pm-github 2026.10.15
description: "pm-gantt-chart merged the rollout (#141) while the caller still pinned pm-github 2026.10.13 (a0880e9). The 2026.10.15 reusable workflow (tag commit 3015930) regenerates the caller's changelog, dispatches the caller's required CI on the sync branch so bot PRs no longer park at action_required, and restricts the sync commit to an allowlist; it needs 'actions: write'. The repin keeps the caller's own file and changes only the pinned ref, the pm-github-version input and the permission."
